<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: SOCCER-LINEUP FOR CZECH REP-SPAIN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LINEUP FOR CZECH REP-SPAIN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the lineups for</p>
<p>the World Cup group Six qualifying match the Czech Republic and</p>
<p>Spain on Wednesday: (Kickoff 1815 GMT)</p>
<p>Referee: Anders Frisk (Sweden)</p>
<p>Czech Republic - 1-Pavel Srnicek, 2-Radoslav Latal, 3-Jan</p>
<p>Suchoparek, 4-Pavel Nedved, 5-Miroslav Kadlec, 6-Michal Hornak,</p>
<p>7-Jiri Nemec, 8-Karel Poborsky, 9-Pavel Kuka, 10-Patrik Berger,</p>
<p>11-Radek Bejbl, 12-Lubos Kubik 13-Tomas Repka, 14-Radovan</p>
<p>Hromadko, 15-Martin Frydek, 16-Petr Kouba, 17-Vladimir Smicer,</p>
<p>18-Pavel Novotny.</p>
<p>Spain - 1-Andoni Zubizarreta, 2-Abelardo Fernandez, 3-Sergi</p>
<p>Barjuan, 4-Rafael Alkorta, 5-Miguel Angel Nadal, 6-Fernando</p>
<p>Hierro, 7-Raul Gonzalez, 8-Luis Enrique Martinez, 9-Guillermo</p>
<p>Amor, 10-Julen Guerrero, 11-Alfonso Perez, 12-Agustin</p>
<p>Aranzabal, 13-Canizares, 14-Josep Guardiola, 15-Roberto Rios,</p>
<p>16-Alberto Belsue,  17-Jose Luis Caminero, 18-Ismael Urzaiz</p>
</text>
